    <seoTitle>
      <Value><![CDATA[Có người đang thúc bạn làm ngay — bạn chưa đưa gì]]></Value>
    </seoTitle>
    <steps>
      <Value><![CDATA[[
  {
    "key": "3d080081-51a3-547c-a35e-994362479a65",
    "isNotice": false,
    "mainText": "D\u1EEBng li\u00EAn l\u1EA1c. Kh\u00F4ng b\u1EA5m v\u00E0o b\u1EA5t k\u1EF3 \u0111\u01B0\u1EDDng link n\u00E0o h\u1ECD \u0111\u00E3 g\u1EEDi.",
    "noticeTitle": "",
    "details": [],
    "sampleScript": "",
    "showBankLookup": false,
    "hasFollowUp": false,
    "links": []
  },
  {
    "key": "b2dbafee-6724-5f55-a996-b909590e201f",
    "isNotice": false,
    "mainText": "T\u1EF1 t\u00ECm \u0111\u01B0\u1EDDng li\u00EAn h\u1EC7 ch\u00EDnh th\u1EE9c c\u1EE7a n\u01A1i \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c nh\u1EAFc t\u1EDBi, r\u1ED3i g\u1ECDi l\u1EA1i \u0111\u1EC3 h\u1ECFi.",
    "noticeTitle": "",
    "details": [
      "L\u1EA5y s\u1ED1 t\u1EEB \u1EE9ng d\u1EE5ng b\u1EA1n \u0111\u00E3 c\u00E0i t\u1EEB tr\u01B0\u1EDBc, t\u1EEB gi\u1EA5y t\u1EDD b\u1EA1n \u0111ang c\u00F3, ho\u1EB7c t\u1EEB c\u1ED5ng th\u00F4ng tin c\u1EE7a c\u01A1 quan nh\u00E0 n\u01B0\u1EDBc.",
      "Kh\u00F4ng d\u00F9ng s\u1ED1 ng\u01B0\u1EDDi \u0111\u00F3 \u0111\u01B0a. C\u0169ng kh\u00F4ng d\u00F9ng s\u1ED1 l\u1EA5y t\u1EEB qu\u1EA3ng c\u00E1o ho\u1EB7c t\u1EEB k\u1EBFt qu\u1EA3 t\u00ECm ki\u1EBFm \u0111\u1EA7u ti\u00EAn \u2014 s\u1ED1 gi\u1EA3 v\u1EABn mua \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c ch\u1ED7 hi\u1EC3n th\u1ECB tr\u00EAn c\u00F9ng."
    ],
    "sampleScript": "",
    "showBankLookup": false,
    "hasFollowUp": false,
    "links": []
  },
  {
    "key": "6c2873d7-3d48-501e-a632-190e13cedd04",
    "isNotice": false,
    "mainText": "Ki\u1EC3m tra t\u00EAn ch\u1EE7 t\u00E0i kho\u1EA3n nh\u1EADn ti\u1EC1n.",
    "noticeTitle": "",
    "details": [
      "T\u00EAn kh\u00F4ng kh\u1EDBp v\u1EDBi b\u00EAn b\u1EA1n \u0111ang giao d\u1ECBch th\u00EC d\u1EEBng l\u1EA1i.",
      "Nh\u01B0ng t\u00EAn kh\u1EDBp c\u0169ng KH\u00D4NG ch\u1EE9ng minh y\u00EAu c\u1EA7u l\u00E0 th\u1EADt. K\u1EBB l\u1EEBa \u0111\u1EA3o c\u00F3 th\u1EC3 d\u00F9ng t\u00E0i kho\u1EA3n mang \u0111\u00FAng t\u00EAn m\u1ED9t doanh nghi\u1EC7p c\u00F3 th\u1EADt."
    ],
    "sampleScript": "",
    "showBankLookup": false,
    "hasFollowUp": false,
    "links": []
  },
  {
    "key": "bc7a5e1a-4468-5fa8-ad5c-837ee11833af",
    "isNotice": false,
    "mainText": "N\u00F3i chuy\u1EC7n v\u1EDBi m\u1ED9t ng\u01B0\u1EDDi b\u1EA1n tin c\u1EADy tr\u01B0\u1EDBc khi quy\u1EBFt \u0111\u1ECBnh.",
    "noticeTitle": "",
    "details": [],
    "sampleScript": "",
    "showBankLookup": false,
    "hasFollowUp": false,
    "links": []
  },
  {
    "key": "a506fe90-d427-53ed-a6c4-836c4e6b9a14",
    "isNotice": false,
    "mainText": "Kh\u00F4ng vay ti\u1EC1n, kh\u00F4ng th\u1EBF ch\u1EA5p t\u00E0i s\u1EA3n \u0111\u1EC3 \u0111\u00E1p \u1EE9ng m\u1ED9t y\u00EAu c\u1EA7u g\u1EA5p.",
    "noticeTitle": "",
    "details": [],
    "sampleScript": "",
    "showBankLookup": false,
    "hasFollowUp": false,
    "links": []
  },
  {
    "key": "93fc3a4e-a351-5aa2-aa6c-e67d66943848",
    "isNotice": false,
    "mainText": "N\u1EBFu vi\u1EC7c b\u1EAFt \u0111\u1EA7u t\u1EEB cu\u1ED9c g\u1ECDi ho\u1EB7c tin nh\u1EAFn, ph\u1EA3n \u00E1nh t\u1EDBi 156.",
    "noticeTitle": "",
    "details": [
      "\u0110\u00E2y l\u00E0 n\u01A1i ph\u1EA3n \u00E1nh cu\u1ED9c g\u1ECDi, tin nh\u1EAFn c\u00F3 d\u1EA5u hi\u1EC7u l\u1EEBa \u0111\u1EA3o. Vi\u1EC7c n\u00E0y kh\u00F4ng thay cho vi\u1EC7c b\u00E1o ng\u00E2n h\u00E0ng hay tr\u00ECnh b\u00E1o C\u00F4ng an."
    ],
    "sampleScript": "",
    "showBankLookup": false,
    "hasFollowUp": false,
    "links": [
      {
        "key": "45bfffb3-f1a5-538d-affa-5a4cc5e3c76a",
        "label": "G\u1ECDi 156",
        "url": "tel:156"
      },
      {
        "key": "f615653c-13a2-5b74-a641-09c9f7e08898",
        "label": "Nh\u1EAFn tin 156",
        "url": "sms:156"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "key": "143995be-5164-55b8-ab02-d27ea2981dcc",
    "isNotice": true,
    "mainText": "",
    "noticeTitle": "\u0110\u1EEBng tr\u1EA3 ph\u00ED cho ng\u01B0\u1EDDi h\u1EE9a l\u1EA5y l\u1EA1i ti\u1EC1n",
    "details": [],
